<!-- KLIC native HTML example. Styles/interactions: component bundle. Pattern reference: https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/blob/481d523374745e77d0cf9c53a4115ab5dd7c8481/apps/v4/examples/base/kbd-group.tsx -->
<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="kbd" data-kv-variant="shortcut" data-klic-component="kbd" class="kn-kbd"><header data-part="heading"><strong>문서 단축키</strong></header><div class="ku-row" data-part="row"><span>검색 열기</span><span><span><kbd>⌘</kbd> <kbd>K</kbd></span></span></div><div class="ku-row" data-part="row"><span>변경 저장</span><span><span><kbd>⌘</kbd> <kbd>S</kbd></span></span></div><p data-part="muted">단축키 표기 예제이며 브라우저 단축키를 가로채지 않습니다.</p></div>
